OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FMark Kopua is a tattoo artist with
OL,10,     Fa difference: he's reviving Ta
OL,11,     FMoko - the ornate tattoos of New
OL,12,     FZealand's Maori culture - while
OL,13,     Fhelping people talk about their
OL,14,     Fmental health.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
